  "question": "Which caf\u00e9 is closest as you go from MAC 650 Gallery, Middletown, CT to Green rooftop garden at design building, Amherst, MA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-72.652064 41.564871)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-72.523498 42.388204)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'cafe'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-72.652064 41.564871)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-72.652064 41.564871)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
